\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  to announce  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 430 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Mai 1999\par 21:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TORONTO, May 12 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  will start making brief announcements when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to both maximize the impact of such action and enhance disclosure, bank officials said on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The new procedure was authorised this week, they told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  Initially, the bank will notify the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market of only the first round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the day, by sending a brief message electronically to news agencies. \par \par \uc2  On the Reuters Terminal, for instance, the message "THE BANK OF \b \highlight22\uc2 CANADA INTERVENES\b0 \highlight\uc2  IN \b \highlight22\uc2 FOREIGN EXCHANGE\b0 \highlight\uc2  MARKET" will appear on page BOFC, where the bank also announces changes in the bank rate, its short-term lending rate. No details - the level of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  or the amount bought or sold - will be disclosed, the officials said. \par \par \uc2  The next step could be to notify the general public by posting information on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's website at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bank-banque-canada.ca/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bank-banque-canada.ca}}}\uc2 . However, the bank is still "looking at" this, one official said. \par \par \uc2  There has been confusion about how the bank would communicate with the market on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since Deputy Governor Charles Freedman briefly announced plans for the move in a speech in Vancouver on March 25. \par \par \uc2  "In order to enhance the signal effect and to avoid any confusion with normal government business in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , we plan to announce our \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  when it occurs," Freedman had said. \par \par \uc2  Another bank official told Reuters at the time that the disclosure would be limited to market players. \par \par \uc2  Last September the Bank of Canada told \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders that it would scrap its customary method of automatically stepping into the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to buy or sell dollars when the market moved a certain extent either way. \par \par \uc2  The latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  was detected last August, when it bought Canadian dollars aggressively in a largely unsuccessful effort to stop a freefall of the Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  triggered by fears of a global market meltdown. The bank was then forced to jack up its short-term lending rate by a full percentage point to lure back investors. \par \par \uc2  The bank would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market when investor confidence was eroded, "a signal to markets that the bank was concerned about the developments and was acting to stabilise the situation, and that if the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unsuccessful it would very likely to be followed up with interest rate action by the bank," Freedman had said in the Vancouver speech. \par \par \uc2  ((Masaru Sato, Reuters Toronto newsroom (416) 941-8107, toronto.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv5c0156s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
