\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  to let traders know of  \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 00:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TORONTO, March 25 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  plans to let \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders know when it has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to maximize the impact of the action, a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "In order to enhance the signal effect and to avoid any confusion with normal government business in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , we plan to announce our \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  when it occurs," Deputy Governor Charles Freedman said in a speech to a business group in Vancouver. \par \par \uc2  Freedman said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  through \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  brokers in a bid to "maintain the effectiveness of the signal." \par \par \uc2  The disclosure is limited to market players, a bank official told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  "We are not going to talk about the size (of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ). If I get a call from one of the market participants, I will be allowed to confirm," he said. "We are not going to be pro-active, we are not going to initiate anything." \par \par \uc2  On September 30, the Bank of Canada told \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders that it would scrap its customary method of automatically stepping into the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to buy or sell dollars when the market moved a certain extent either way. \par \par \uc2  The bank would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market when investor confidence was eroded, "a signal to markets that the bank was concerned about the developments and was acting to stabilise the situation, and that if the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unsuccessful it would very likely to be followed up with interest rate action by the bank," Freedman said. \par \par \uc2  ((Masaru Sato, Reuters Toronto newsroom (416) 941-8107, toronto.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv3p087vx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
