\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  to announce  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 477 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 21:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  VANCOUVER, March 25 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  will saywhen it has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in future in order to maximize the impact of such action, a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "In order to enhance the signal effect and to avoid any confusion with normal government business in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , we plan to announce our \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  when it occurs," Deputy Governor Charles Freedman said in a speech to a business group made available to the news media. \par \par \uc2  He was speaking on "policy-making under uncertainty" at an annual general meeting of the International Swaps and Derivatives Association in Vancouver. \par \par \uc2  Freedman did not elaborate further in the speech, and no other Bank of Canada officials were immediately available for comment. \par \par \uc2  Freedman said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  through \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  brokers in a bid to "maintain the effectiveness of the signal." \par \par \uc2  Last year the Bank of Canada announced that it would scrap its customary method of automatically stepping into the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to buy or sell dollars when the market moved a certain extent either way. \par \par \uc2  The bank would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market when investor confidence was eroded, "a signal to markets that the bank was concerned about the developments and was acting to stabilise the situation, and that if the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unsuccessful it would very likely to be followed up with interest rate action by the bank," Freedman said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  staged aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  last August in a largely unsuccessful effort to stop a freefall of the Canadian dollar triggered by fears of a global market meltdown. The bank was then forced to jack up its short-term lending rate by a full percentage point to lure back investors. \par \par \uc2  Freedman's comments were in line with a speech delivered by Governor Gordon Thiessen on Monday. Freedman said the underlying momentum of the Canadian economy is healthy and intense retail competition and excess supply in product markets have kept overall inflation in Canada "somewhat below expectations." \par \par \uc2  The easing of financial market crises "has made it possible to refocus attention on the medium-term policy objective of keeping the trend of inflation inside the target range" of 1-3 percent," he said. \par \par \uc2  On monetary policy changes, Freedman stuck to what the bank does about short-term rates in general terms - tightens credit when inflationary pressures mount and brings about easier money conditions when the inflation rate comes under downward pressures. \par \par \uc2  He repeated that the bank's policy is to use its monetary conditions index (MCI), which is based on movements in the Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and short-term rates, only as a "guide" to policy, and not as a short-term target. \par \par \uc2  ($1=$1.51 Canadian) \par \par \uc2  ((Masaru Sato, Reuters Toronto newsroom (416) 941-8107, toronto.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv3p087qt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
