\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  To Announce All Future  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 19:47\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  VANCOUVER (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  intends to officially announce future \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a senior official of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Charles Freedman, deputy governor for Monetary Policy & Financial Analysis, told the International Swaps & Derivatives Association's annual conference in Vancouver that the bank will announce each \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  "when it occurs" in order to "enhance the signal effect" of monetary \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Last September, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  dropped its policy of symmetrical \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  - automatically \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  whenever the Canadian dollar rose or fell a predetermined amount in a single day. These were highly predictable for \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, as they essentially guaranteed the Bank of Canada would step into the market once the Canadian dollar moved a fixed amount. The Bank also had a policy of asymmetrical \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which Freedman described as "\b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  before the automatic limits were breached and/or in amounts that were larger than customary." \par \par \uc2  Freedman said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  "will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a discretionary manner when it is deemed appropriate." He said such an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  "would be a signal to markets that the bank was concerned...and was acting to stabilize the situation. And if the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unsuccessful it would very likely be followed up with interest rate action by the bank." \par \par \uc2  Freedman added that "in order to maintain the effectiveness of the signal, we intend to continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  through the brokers." \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  03-25-99 \par \par \uc2  1347EST \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010826dv3p00kkf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
