at that point had been under sustained selling pressure for weeks. \par \par \uc2  "So far things are working well for them - I think they're breathing a little bit easier. But also, they're lucky there's just been a big sell off in the Big Dollar all around the world," the trader said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par These are the exchange rates at 9:03 a.m. EDT (1303 GMT), 8:00 a.m.\par EDT (1200 GMT), and late Wednesday.\par    U.S./CDN    1.5092    1.5120    1.5225\par    CDN/DEM     1.1253    1.1245    1.1300\par    CDN/YEN     89.29     88.96     89.87\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 10-09-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1323GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du9a07sph\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
