\par\par \b \uc2  =Bk Of  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2 's Feisty  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\uc2  Seen Draining Reserves \b0\par\par\uc2  By Don Curren \par \uc2 336 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 September 1998\par 20:50\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    TORONTO (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's pugnacious\par approach to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in August could\par have depleted its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves by US$5 billion\par or even more, some economists say.\par    The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's unusually aggressive \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par tactics last month have generated a broad range of\par projections of how much the bank's reserves have been\par drained, with economist opinions ranging from about US$2\par billion to US$5 billion or higher.\par    The federal department of finance releases information\par about the size of the Bank of Canada's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par reserves Thursday at 8:15 a.m. EDT (1215 GMT). Last month,\par the department reported that reserves in July rose US$2.6\par billion to US$22.52 billion.\par    The figures will be even more closely watched than usual\par since the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  embraced a more aggressive and varied\par style of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  last month in response to the intense\par pressure on the Canadian dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    "There's been a lot of speculation about the magnitudes\par that were involved during the aggressive \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," said\par Marcel Kasumovich, an economist with Goldman Sachs in\par Toronto.\par    In August, the bank deviated from its usual, unofficial\par policy of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets whenever the U.S.\par dollar moves 70 ticks against the Canadian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on an\par intraday basis.\par    Beginning on Aug. 7, when the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par massively and aggressively in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  traders started coming into markets early, choosing\par unpredictable levels that were often well in advance of the\par usual triggers.\par    While the bank has \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  early in other periods of\par pressure against the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , in August it did so with\par particular frequency and emphasis. During the week of Aug.\par 10, the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets every\par day except for Friday.\par    In recent days, as the pressure against the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has\par subsided somewhat, the pace of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has also\par relented.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  09-02-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1450EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4240 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du92023no\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
