\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  Afternoon: C$ Tumbles Lower Desite BOC  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 297 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 August 1998\par 22:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (Dow Jones)--The Canadian dollar stumbled again on Monday, lurching to another all-time low and prompting more \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading at C$1.5490 at 4:01 p.m. EDT (2001 GMT), from C$1.5417 at 8:00 a.m. EDT (1200 GMT), and C$1.5443 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  It reached C$1.5502 - an all-time record high - at 12:15 p.m. EDT (1615 GMT) before drifting slightly lower on routine consolidation. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  began \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  around C$1.5465, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  failed to arrest the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decline. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 11 of the last 13 trading days. \par \par \uc2  "I think this is the kind of scenario we might have to get used to in days to come," said one Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader, pointing to a bevy of negative factors that continue to bedevil the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "I think there is nothing to hold up the dollar beside a rate increase - which won't be happening," the trader said. \par \par \uc2  The continuing turmoil in Asia, coupled with \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and financial system problems in Russia and Latin America, are combining to put acute pressure on the Canadian unit, the trader said. \par \par \uc2  "Altogether, it's a recipe for a big, big disaster," he said. \par \par \uc2  Trading volumes in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  were average on Monday, he added. \par \par \uc2  Monday's downward move was a continuation of the downward push triggered on Friday when the U.S. dollar broke through the C$1.5350 area, the levels which coincided with the beginning of the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 's more aggressive style of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier this month. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 24-08-98 \par \par \uc2  2006GMT \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8o076s5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
