\par\par \b \uc2  Canada Afternoon: C$ Plunges To New All-Time Low \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 1998\par 22:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (Dow Jones)--The Canadian dollar plummetted to new all-time spot and closing lows Friday in active, volatile trading, battered by the waves of international turmoil that shook financial markets around the globe. \par \par \uc2  The Canadian unit's fall past the C$1.5400 mark took place despite numerous sizeable waves of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  mid-session by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading at C$1.5443 at 4:56 p.m. EDT (2056 GMT), from C$1.5316 at 8:00 a.m. EDT (1200 GMT), and C$1.5315 late Thursday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  watchers said speculative pressure against the Canadian unit mounted midway through the morning session, as the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bonds caught an overpowering safe-haven bid. \par \par \uc2  When the U.S. unit's move above its previous historical spot high of C$1.5355 drew only slight \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , more \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar sellers emerged to drive the Canadian unit to new intraday lows. \par \par \uc2  But the move stalled on heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the U.S. dollar surmounted the C$1.5400 mark. \par \par \uc2  "The bank seemed to hit the market hard at the C$1.5420 level," said Susan Stearns, director of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the Bank of Montreal in New York. "That pretty much stopped the flow there when it became known that they were moving aggressively instead of the previous tepid little \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 21-08-98 \par \par \uc2  2059GMT \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8l075cv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
