\par\par \b \uc2  Australia Yield Spreads-N.Z. races away vs bloc. \b0\par\par\uc2 445 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 August 1998\par 06:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  --------------------------------------------------------- \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  AUD VS   3-YR\tab    10-YR\tab * AUD 3-YR/10-YR SPREAD\par  USD\tab -05 (+ 02)   +17 (+ 03) * FUTURES   29   (UNCH)\par  CAD\tab -24 (- 01)   -04 (UNCH) * CASH\tab 32   (UNCH)\par  NZD\tab -89 (+ 34)   -50 (+ 14) *\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ---------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SYDNEY, Aug 20 (Reuters) - New Zealand bonds showed a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par strong outperformance against the dollar bloc after the Reserve\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bank of New Zealand proved more aggressive in its easing of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par monetary conditions in its quarterly Monetary Policy Statement.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The central said a Monetary Conditions Index of zero was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par appropriate for the December quarter, cutting its index target\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par by 350 points from its September quarter projection.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "While the endorsement was greater than the market had been\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par expecting, it was the projection of aggressively easier\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par monetary conditions in 1999 that confirmed the clear stance of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par monetary policy as the RBNZ struggles to revive the NZ\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par economy", said Su Lin Ong, senior economist at RBC DS Global\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Markets.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  projected an MCI of minus 150 points in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the March quarter 1999, minus 200 points in the June quarter\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and minus 225 points in the September quarter.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par New Zealand's 10-year bond yield premium over Australia\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par shrank to its lowest level since December at around 50 basis\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par points, narrowin from a high of some 125 basis points in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par mid-June, and having been anticipated easier monetary\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par conditions in recent weeks.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     RBC's Ong said that against the U.S. she saw the spread\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par narrowing towards 25 basis points on a six to 12 months target.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "Lower interest rates should continue to do more of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par work in driving overall easier monetary conditions in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par coming quarters, although much will depend on whether the New\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Zealand dollar finds a base," Ong said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The kiwi dollar fell through 50.00 U.S. cents on the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par statement, and this brushed off on the Aussie dollar, which was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par already weakening on offshore options related selling.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A fall through 59.00 cents on the Aussie tripped the local\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par bonds at the opening and saw it show an underperforming bias\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par against the bloc.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par However, this spread widening was less notable against\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Canada, which remains under a cloud due to sustained weakness\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par in the Canadian dollar and despite continued \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par efforts by the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to shore up the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par This kept Canada's 10-year yield at a small premium over\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Australia, having broken parity for the first time since\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par February 1994 on Wednesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     U.S. Treasuries were little changed in Tokyo from the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par narrowly mixed levels in New York.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ((Colin Brinsden, 61-2 9373-1800,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     sydney.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1998.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8k01786\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
